#api call for admin login
###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/user/admin/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"admin",
     "password":"admin@123" 
}

#  "token": "415c13cd1226a9335bc1879650ad9285af0621f8"


